{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24946","headline":"归马华山 · 白行简","name":"归马华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牧野功成後，周王战马闲。\n驱驰休伏皁，饮齕任依山。\n逐日朝仍去，随风暮自还。\n冰生疑陇坂，叶落似榆关。\n躞蹀仙峰下，腾骧渭水湾。\n幸逢时偃武，不复鼓鼙间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白行简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}